{"text": "يبدأ الرمز بصفر.", "mentions": [{"start": 11, "end": 15, "value": "0", "kind": "cardinal"}], "source": "CLDR RBNF ar: \"0: صفر\"; ب is a joined preposition, so the span covers the word."}
